# Sub-tick corpus for the terrain env-anim colour path (terrain-canim). Row
# grammar and what the statistic means: see
# games/spyro-1/corpus/terrain-canim-subtick-corpus.manifest.
#
# Census of the colour sub-list (sectors named at --skip-to-level, VBL
# 2300): idol_springs 6, aquaria_towers 4, mystic_marsh 4, summer_forest 3,
# sunny_beach 2, autumn_plains 1, dragon_shores 1, every other level 0. No
# movie in this game's corpus visits one, so the row boots Idol Springs with
# --skip-to-level at its spawn view, where the legs separate by 2562 px at
# alpha 1, a mean step of 0.52 levels, and the retained cache draws 5 of the
# animated sectors (the capture under OPENPETE_TERRAIN_CACHE_FORCE=1 is
# pixel-identical to the walk's). aquaria_towers at its spawn view differs in
# 0 px at every alpha.
idol-springs | 2400 | level=idol_springs
